# Each half of Dead // Gone cast alone (CR 709.3). Dead ({R}) deals 2 damage to any creature, either player's, and
# nothing else: Bot2's Mox Emerald and Bot2 are refused, Bot2's Blind Phantasm (toughness 3) survives with 2 damage,
# Bot1's own Ornithopter (toughness exactly 2) dies. Gone ({2}{R}) returns only a creature its caster does not control:
# Bot1's own Ornithopter and Bot2's noncreature Mox Emerald are refused, Bot2's Blind Phantasm goes to its owner's hand.
# Paid exactly.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Dead // Gone
Dead // Gone
Dead // Gone
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Grizzly Bears
Blind Phantasm
Island x20

